	(text "Supply and charger (stand-ins)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.145 19.304 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "83cf90ed-2e42-592f-8f5c-932339690cfa")
	)
	(text "V102 stands for the 3.3 V regulator U2. B101 stands for the charger and the PD chip U1:\nVBUS is V101 (20, 15 or 12 V) while VSET is high, and 5 V while the limiter holds VSET low.\nIt follows VSET about 0.1 s late (R106, C106); the real chip's delay is not specified.\nVBUS rises during the first millisecond of a run."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.78 80.01 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "528a63ef-d873-58c9-9e11-a509531de005")
	)
	(text "Over-temperature limiter (second sensor)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.145 105.664 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "7aee558f-5f6d-5f4f-a6af-7068a5564c2e")
	)
	(text "RT2 above 138 °C: LIM_N goes low and stays low until 127 °C (hysteresis by R11).\nThen U3B holds the gate low and U4B shorts VSET, so the charger falls back to 5 V:\n1/16 of the heater power, even with Q1 failed short."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.78 159.385 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "019ea65d-fb2a-53fd-9ca2-fe069debae0e")
	)
	(text "Thermostat"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.145 180.594 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "1d471a13-56b3-5053-bf44-8d81598ebb27")
	)
	(text "RV1 sets the temperature: 43 °C fully anticlockwise, 121 °C fully clockwise.\nHeater off above the set point, on again 0.9 K below it (R10).\nRV1's position (pos, 0 to 1) is the trimmer's travel: 0.535 is 100 °C."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 71.12 222.885 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "3c04b07c-06cd-563d-a3f4-20f730d13953")
	)
	(text "Heater and switch"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 194.945 155.194 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "577640a0-46fd-538e-a721-99584bcbe04e")
	)
	(text "HTR1 is the heater trace: 9.0 Ω at 20 °C, rising with the plate temperature.\nR2 and the gate charge of Q1 set the switching edges.\nR105 = 0.01 makes Q1 a failed, shorted switch (1G: no fault)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 195.58 217.805 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "244bc40a-8ee3-56ee-84ca-24dedf218f4d")
	)
	(text "Plate (thermal model)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 161.925 19.304 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "70a440fd-906f-5c28-8c25-1f61e7389784")
	)
	(text "The plate through its thickness as an electrical network: 1 V = 1 °C, 1 µA = 1 W, 1 MΩ = 1 K/W, 1 µF = 1 J/K.\nC110 is the top copper, C111 to C118 are eight slices of FR-4, C119 the underside copper (calc/thermal.py).\nB102 feeds in the heater's electrical power. B103 and B104 are the losses to the air at V103, the room.\nR103 is an object on the plate: 6.8M takes 30 W/m²K more than free air (1000G: nothing).\nRT1 and RT2 read T_NTC: 70 % top copper, 30 % underside, 0.8 s behind."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 231.14 68.58 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "76974444-6879-5053-a7f0-11bdbe47d343")
	)
	(text "Simulation"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 291.465 105.664 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c4eea32d-dad7-5a72-8054-b5e15b5719d4")
	)
	(text ".tran 20m 150 0 20m"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 292.1 113.03 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "3dcaa25c-8ca3-5be8-9bb9-e7fa083d7494")
	)
	(text ".options method=gear"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 330.2 113.03 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ab18e85e-e80f-5967-9397-daccd68eccce")
	)
	(text "Inspect > Simulator, then Run. Temperatures are plotted in volts: 100 V is 100 °C.\nThe run starts with the plate at room temperature and the charger plugged in at time 0.\nWith the Tune tool: RV1 turns the trimmer, V101 is the charger voltage, V103 the room\ntemperature. R105 = 0.01 shorts the switch, R103 = 6.8M puts an object on the plate.\nThe comparator model and its limits: sim/models/heater_sim.lib."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 292.1 121.92 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "26123d11-fb24-5313-bce9-cf16a6d74975")
	)
